WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:26.730
Cosmo and the others planned to buy themselves
some time with peace negotiations.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:32.530
However, the Buff Clan aliens 
attempted to shoot even Karala.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:38.570
The enemy commander Gamus
is a man who lives only to fight.

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.590
However, Gamus realized the true abilities
 of the Ideon and Solo Ship...

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.610
...and retreated to plan out an all out attack.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.820
I'll have the Bufu siblings attack them!

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:15.360
<b>Attack of the Twin Devils</b>

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.460
Hey, don't fall asleep! Your leg might get eaten!

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:23.630
What kind of fish is that?!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.200
They've gotten big.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.410
They're going to lay eggs soon too!

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:33.140
Yeah, I can eat a ton of omelets.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.120
No way! I won't let you have any!

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:37.170
Stingy!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.090
It was about two years ago.

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.190
Meteors started falling on our Buff Clan Earth.

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.530
There's been thirteen in two years.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:02.480
Logo Dau...

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:07.100
In other words, the planet that you call "Solo"
is where they came from.

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:12.790
We thought that there must be some
 great power causing it to happen.

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.470
Is that the Ide?

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:15.210
Yes.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.160
It coincides with the legend of Ide.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.380
That reminds me, the same sort of incident
has happened on our Earth.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.520
This is a news video from two years ago.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.380
The first one fell on New York.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:27.910
Ah, now that you mention it...

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.560
On your Earth too?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.590
As of now, how many have there been?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.630
News topics related to meteors...

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:36.210
There's twelve of them!

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.800
But we haven't received any news since Brazillier...

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:42.410
For all we know, there may have been
thirteen or fourteen by now.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:46.500
The amount matches too well 
for this to be a coincidence...

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.360
Bes, is the Ide really just a form of energy?

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.930
Our scientists thought it was similar to solar energy.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.280
And furthermore, it could be able to even move meteors...

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:58.000
But...

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.640
Do you think it could be used in practice?

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:05.720
My father Doba said that the whole universe
 would be at peace if we could control the Ide.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.180
If there's a relation between the meteors and Ide...

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:12.190
Could we really control that kind of energy?

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.800
Well then, are you heading back
 to the Buff Clan home world?

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:44.090
I need to have the material we have gathered
thus far analyzed back at home.

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.400
I see...

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.590
Gamus... I want to bring back home a souvenir.

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:50.010
Huh?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:51.890
Karala would be nice.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:53.480
Lady Karala?!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:55.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.650
Certainly, as you wish!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.210
I'd also like to obtain at least a
 fragment of the Giant. Get it for me.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:04.370
Please leave it to me.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.860
My dear ill-mannered sister...

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:16.890
Doppa Bufu!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:17.460
Yes sir!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.960
Your Rogg Mack will lead the right formation.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:20.290
Yes sir!

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.600
Kiyaya Bufu!

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:22.140
Yes sir!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.450
Your Rogg Mack will lead the left formation.

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:24.970
Yes sir!

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:29.230
Make the best use of your special qualities
 and aid me with your teamwork.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.570
Yes, Sir Gamus.

00:05:31.620 --> 00:05:32.940
Leave it to us, we won't fail.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.020
Deck, stop it!

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.740
You don't know what kind of fish live here! Cut it out!

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.320
Don't stop!

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:48.010
I won't!

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:51.730
Get back in!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:52.870
Stand back!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:00.970
You fished up this thing?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.680
Excuse me, can you throw this thing away?

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.400
This isn't planet Solo!

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.380
You shouldn't go carelessly fishing for things!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.590
Deck, go clean the cockpit.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.560
Lin, be careful.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:19.740
Okay.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:21.060
Really...

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.790
The radar is turned off? Why?

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:24.680
There's nothing we can do, it's being fixed!

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.530
The radar is turned off?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:31.320
How is it, Hatari?

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.810
Adjust it two degrees to the right.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:34.870
Okay.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.670
Hold on, that's a bit too much. Turn it back a little.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.650
Bes! What are you doing?

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:44.440
We're adjusting the antenna to make it
 locate coordinates from every direction.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.010
Thus we can't use it for a moment.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:50.220
While you're adjusting, the radar's dead, right?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:51.420
Don't you care?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.480
Don't worry, we'll be finished soon.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.350
Enemy attack!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:56.060
What!?

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.120
Get inside!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.310
Logo Dau aliens... You're not getting away this time!

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.370
Take this!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:25.920
Damn it!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.500
How many enemies are there?

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:48.370
I don't know.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.790
Enemy squadron on our right!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:51.530
On the left too!

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:01.860
Big brother Doppa!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.950
Let's make this our final attack.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.410
If four Rogg Macks attack simultaneously,
 even that ship should go down!

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.020
Fine by me!

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:11.090
Prolonging this any further would be pointless.

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:18.520
They're coming!

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:20.050
Can't you raise the barrier?!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.160
Fire a barrage!

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:32.280
It looks like we have a direct
hit on the alien ship!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.490
Good! I knew the Bufu twins could do it!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.320
No matter what, their ship can't survive 
that many direct hits!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.730
Don't let your guard down just yet!
 There are still enemies left!

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.050
Launch another all-out attack against them!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.710
Isn't that ship damaged at all?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.110
How could it be?

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:57.970
Big brother!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.910
Trust the Rogg Mack's abilities!

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:01.310
Yes!

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:09.150
Those must be Gamus' troops...

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:16.490
If the barrier's in the way, could we
 concentrate fire on a single spot?

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.920
Come on, go inside!

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.290
There, over there!

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.070
Ashura!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.880
Hurry up! It's dangerous!

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.260
Lou, don't go over there!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:37.380
Don't do it!

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:43.060
Piece of junk!

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:45.660
Hurry up!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.070
Deck, how is it? Can we go?

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.820
We can't launch in the middle of an attack!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.520
What did the bridge say?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.440
Fire, fire, fire! That's all.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.850
We're not going to hit anything from here, though.

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:04.200
Ashura!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.720
Get back here, Ashura!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:07.660
The chickens...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:08.790
It dangerous here. So...

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.750
My chickens!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.250
Ashura!
My chickens!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.620
Karala! Are you alright?

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.760
Yes, I'm fine!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:23.390
Karala!

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:26.790
Those two Heavy Mobile Mecha units
 under Gamus' command got me worried.

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:30.930
He has subordinates known as the
 Twin Devils, the Bufu siblings.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.440
Their teamwork makes them completely
 different from normal soldiers!

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:38.810
It's said that something similar to telepathy
 can develop between twin siblings.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:39.900
What if...

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.570
Are those twins psychic?

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:46.410
Psychic? A superman?

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:47.320
Oh, never mind.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.330
Cosmo!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.420
Watch out for the Heavy Mobile Mecha's teamwork!

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:52.700
These are tough enemies!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.920
Do something about the barrier!

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.180
Hatari! What's the status of the Ideon Gauge?!

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:02.070
Joliver! Raise the power of the normal engine!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.100
I'm doing it! Try to hold them off!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.380
Deck, let's lift off!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.760
We're not going down without a fight!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.710
The Ideon Gauge is lighting up!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.800
Activate the barrier!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.720
Then we can have all the Ideon units dock!

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:37.340
You want to raise the barrier on the sea?

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:38.380
I don't care!

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:56.990
Big brother!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.380
They raised a barrier?

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.530
Those aliens...

00:12:30.550 --> 00:12:31.940
Get closer and fire at them!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.380
They're trying to launch that Giant 
while we're wasting time!

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:37.130
Sir!

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:41.610
To launch the Giant, they have no choice but to
 deactivate the barrier for a moment.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:42.570
We'll strike then!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.160
All right, engage them in close combat 
with your Rogg Macks!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.360
Starboard side, can you detect anything?

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:02.600
In front! The enemy ship has stopped moving!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:04.760
Watch out for movement on the port side!

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.270
Can we use the underwater sensor?

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:08.340
It's impossible!

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.300
The barrier is obstructing it!

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:12.480
Stay vigilant in every direction!

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:14.020
Find the enemy by eye!

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:28.830
The barrier is starting to fade!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.770
Attack them from every direction! 
Don't fall behind, Kiyaya!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:32.810
Leave it to me!

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.480
I won't fall behind, brother!

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:35.970
Tomuro and Baruba, you too!

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:36.680
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:37.260 --> 00:13:38.070
I'm up to it!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:45.130
Clear the barrier!

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:46.460
Ideon, launch!

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.100
The barrier is gone!

00:13:53.340 --> 00:13:54.460
Begin the attack!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.680
Understood, brother!

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:02.790
The Giant is here!

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.330
Gondo Bau squad, go!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.040
Where are Doppa and Kiyaya?

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:08.990
Me too!

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.540
Everyone, find some place to sit down!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.360
Release the missiles and retreat immediately!

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:36.340
Did it work?!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.260
Brother!

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:44.920
This doesn't look like a flash from an explosion!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.500
What's up with that light?

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:55.740
Cosmo!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.770
There's a strange light coming from the Solo Ship!

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.780
Ask them what they're doing!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.320
Roger!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.130
They're tough!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:08.620
Deck! How's the Solo Ship?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:09.240
Wait!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:10.060
Hurry up!

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:21.050
Deck, what about the Solo Ship?!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.210
I can't hear too well, but the barrier is up!

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:25.890
The barrier?

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:27.480
Sheryl!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.270
Get Karala into bed!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.060
Yes!

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.070
Main Cannon!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.980
Fire consecutive shots horizontally in groups of three!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.460
It should have gotten weaker from the previous attack!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.170
I'll finish it off!

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:51.240
Baruba's Rogg Mack!

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.210
Kiyaya!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:53.140
Ready for a suicide attack!

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.970
Give me cover fire!

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:56.870
Yes, brother!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:01.980
Watch this, Baruba!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.680
I'll break that barrier, even if it costs my life!

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.280
Power!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.240
I need more power!

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.500
Brother, are you alright?

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:19.690
If only I had even a bit more power...

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:22.140
Only a bit more, brother! Give it all you've got!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.990
I'll attack them from the sea!

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.180
Kiyaya, it's up to you!

00:16:25.240 --> 00:16:26.420
I can still hold on for a while!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:34.790
Break that barrier, Rogg Mack!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:36.840
Go!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.830
Yes! I managed to get in!

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:41.660
All right!

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:46.140
Hatari! Cut the barrier!

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:47.960
Cut the barrier?!

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:48.760
You're crazy!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:50.000
Cut it!

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.270
My brother is calling...

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.520
It's up to you to take down the enemy! Go!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.490
Brother!

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:07.940
I won't let you do that!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:14.340
Brother!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.120
It may be hopeless, but...

00:17:34.220 --> 00:17:35.250
Kiyaya!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.160
My brother... He's dead...

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:41.450
Brother!

00:17:46.490 --> 00:17:47.320
Brother!

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.820
I'll make them pay for this!!

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.460
Commander Gamus!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.390
I'm going to follow my brother
 and launch a suicide attack!

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:05.480
Please cover me!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.890
Don't lose to your brother!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:07.180
Yes!

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:12.610
Big brother... To live up to my rank as a Zout...

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.990
I'll die with glory as a soldier, just like you!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:23.240
Big brother!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.190
A Heavy Mobile Mecha has latched onto our barrier!

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.670
Can't we shoot it?

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.250
Hatari! Shake it off!

00:18:31.660 --> 00:18:32.850
Okay! We'll fly up!

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:33.800
Joliver!

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:36.170
The normal engine is powered up!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.800
You're all going to die!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:46.620
All of you!

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.860
Lady Kiyaya!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.450
Solo Ship is getting beaten!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.050
Damned Giant!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.640
They're still alive!

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:11.500
Why won't you fall?! Damn Giant!

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:12.890
Why won't you fall?!

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:16.660
Okay!

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:51.640
All signs of life have vanished at the Gamus fleet.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.490
I see...

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:54.990
That Gamus...

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:57.860
He only got more of my subordinates killed in vain.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:58.780
Yes.

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:02.810
We'll analyze the footage recovered from
 our research probes as fast as possible.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:09.640
I heard you have searched for space-time distortions
 coming from the Logo Dau aliens' ship.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:10.210
Yes.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.930
Is that the Ide's power?

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:13.740
We cannot say anything for certain.

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:18.250
However, it is highly unlikely a mere tool of combat.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.050
This is troubling...

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:21.400
Huh?

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.920
Suppose that Giant was to attack our planet...

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.690
What would happen?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.270
We can't compete with a power
 capable of controlling the universe.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.690
The Buff Clan would head towards 
the path to destruction.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.560
It'll take us three days for repairs...

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:48.740
If we spend half a day on fixing leaks,
 we should be able to fly again.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.390
That's fine. We'll leave this planet then.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:53.020
Where are we planning on going?

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:54.860
Let's go back to Earth.

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:56.260
To Earth?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:21:00.880
After their loss today, the Buff Clan
shouldn't come after us anymore, right?

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:02.270
I don't know.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.030
With the Ide's power manifesting in this form...

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.480
I don't know what my father is going to do...

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:12.540
I think I get it.

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:19.790
Why do we fight? Isn't it because 
we are afraid of the Buff Clan?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:24.400
That's right... It's because we're afraid getting killed.

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:27.140
Isn't it the same with the Buff Clan?

00:21:28.360 --> 00:21:30.360
The Ideon and the Solo Ship...

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.530
The Buff Clan is driven by their
 constantly growing fear of them.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.810
That's why they fight.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:38.760
What Cosmo is saying is right.

00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:42.780
I think the way the Solo Ship powered
 up today was abnormal.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:46.990
From my position as a pilot, it's like
 the ship did that on its own.

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:48.440
Ah, that's right.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.740
If that was the power of Ide,
 it's like it has a will of its own.

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.300
Are you saying that the Ide can think?

00:21:57.410 --> 00:21:58.750
Didn't the computer do that?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.290
With the learning ability of an advanced computer...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:03.170
I think that sort of thing could be possible.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:06.140
We'll look into that together.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.570
We're leaving this planet in five hours.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:11.850
If the Buff Clan is afraid of our power...

00:22:12.190 --> 00:22:18.480
We have no choice but to run to the end
 of the universe to avoid any further fights.

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:32.530
The Solo Ship continues to set out
on its never ending odyssey.

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:39.710
Only the twinkling stars await before it.

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:52.530
<i>Does the Solo Ship's power draw things to it?</i>

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.580
<i>Like a fated encounter, the enemy's
 battleship appears before them.</i>

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:02.090
<i>When the enemy engages in close combat, Cosmo
 and the others fight back with all their might.</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:04.940
<i>As the enemy soldiers run inside the Solo Ship,</i>

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:07.810
<i>the Ideon punches right through
the enemy battleship!</i>

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:13.570
<i>Next time, on Legendary Giant Ideon:
 "Sink the Enemy Battleship"</i>

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:17.600
<b>Next Episode</b>

